      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Protecting 3D content is absolutely impossible. It is an endless arms race that can’t be won. Anyone who wants to download a .jpg from the internet can do so no matter how much of website attempts to hide the URL in the source code. If it can be displayed, the browser can download it. The same is true for models files in games.",
